===Etymology===
From {{inh|fi|urj-fin-pro|*käki}}, either a {{der|fi|bat}} loanword or an [[onomatopoeia]]. Related to {{cog|et|kägu}}, {{cog|krl|käki}}, {{cog|liv|kä’g}}, {{cog|vep|kägi}}, {{cog|vot|tšako}} and {{cog|se|giehka}}.

